{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45681","headline":"上卢使君 · 贯休","name":"上卢使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夔龙在庙堂，虽然有佥议。\n苍生得父母，自是天之意。\n鄱阳气候正，文物皆鲜媚。\n金镜有余光，春风少闲地。\n膺门倚寒碧，到者宁容易。\n宾从皆凤毛，爪牙悉猨臂。\n楼台千万户，锦绣龙歌沸。\n大惠虫鸟全，至严龙虎畏。\n可怜召伯树，婆裟不胜翠。\n诗搜日月华，道咽神仙味。\n嘉树白雀来，祥烟甘露坠。\n中川一带香，□开幽邃地。\n逸少情有余，东山境不啻。\n恭闻圣天子，廊庙犹虚位。\n应知黎庶心，只恐徵书至。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}